General_SiSo_Auto_KPI_PM_Counters_comparison_between_configurations
    [Documentation]
    ...    Purpose of this test case is to verify KPIs and PMs counters values generated during L3 Call procedure,
    ...    by comparing reports from two runs with different scf configurations using Scout Comparator tool. This test requires SCF
    ...    with BARRED cells except the one user want to perform L3 Call procedure on.
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - cell_id (str/int) - config ID of the cell that L3 call operation will be performed on.
    ...              - cell_type (str) - RAT type of called cell: 'nr' or 'lte'
    ...              - scout_tl_name (str) - name of BTS in Scout Tool, e.g. 10_16_40703-50703_MRBTS-40703
    ...              - scout_template_id (str/int) - id of template that user what to use in Scout Comparator report
    ...              - first_scf_file_path (str) - full absolute path to SCF file that will be used for first commissioning
    ...                                            and measurements gathering
    ...              - second_scf_file_path (str) - full absolute path to SCF file that will be used for second commissioning
    ...                                             and measurements gathering
    ...              - throughputs (dict) - dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                     it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells.
    ...                                     Example:
    ...                              {
    ...                                  '827736065':
    ...                                       {
    ...                                           'throughput':
    ...                                               {
    ...                                                   'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                   'uplink': '0 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                               },
    ...                                           'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                       },
    ...                              }
    ...              - protocol (str) - data transfer protocol. Defaults to UDP.
    ...              - udp_buffer (str) - monitoring data buffer. Defaults to 4M.
    ...              - ue_network_modes (dict) - dictionary with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"};
    ...                                          possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE;
    ...                                          When using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                          with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                          Mandatory for SA+NSA setups. Defaults to None.
    ...              - linux_congestion (str) - option "-Z" for iperf2. TCP congestion algorithm (Linux and FreeBSD only).
    ...                                         To check supported algorithms use `sysctl net.ipv4.tcp_available_congestion_control` command.
    ...                                         Defaults to None means that option will not be used.
    ...              - measurement_interval (str/int) - measurement interval defined in minutes, related to single measurement frame duration
    ...                                                 set in SCF configuration. One of following values possible to set:
    ...                                                 15min, 30min, or 60min, defaults to 15min.
    ...              - start_l3call_before_new_measurement (str/int) - time defined in minutes before new measurement frame start
    ...                                                                when L3 Call procedure should be started. Defaults to 5min.
    ...              - cycles (str/int) - number of full measurement interval cycles, starting from the first new measurement, e.g. there's 11:10,
    ...                                   measurement_interval is set to 15min and cycles is set to 3. It's 5 minutes before new measurement start at 11:15 and
    ...                                   for 3 full measurement cycles the ending of last measurement will be at 12:00. Defaults to 1.
    ...              - alpha (str/float) - the alpha index, used in the t-test calculation, e.g. 0.005. Defaults to 0.005.
    ...              - prepare_cells_to_call (bool) - whether to prepare the cells for L3 Call procedure by unblocking/unbarring them
    ...                                               before starting L3 Call and blocking/barring them back after L3 Call is finished.
    ...                                               Defaults to True.
    ...              - ignored_cells_on_preparation (list) - SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                                      list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                                      L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred.
    ...                                                      Example: ['BTS-40703/NR-3','BTS-40703/LTE-7']
    ...                                                      Defaults to None.

    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${cell_type}
    ...            ${scout_tl_name}
    ...            ${scout_template_id}
    ...            ${first_scf_file_path}
    ...            ${second_scf_file_path}
    ...            ${throughputs}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...            ${linux_congestion}=${None}
    ...            ${measurement_interval}=15min
    ...            ${start_l3call_before_new_measurement}=5min
    ...            ${cycles}=1
    ...            ${alpha}=0.005
    ...            ${prepare_cells_to_call}=${True}
    ...            ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing commissioning with first SCF file: ${first_scf_file_path}
    Perform commissioning and achieve On Air                scf_file_path=${first_scf_file_path}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set Test Variable                                       ${return_to_initial_scf}
    ...                                                     ${True}

    ${first_measurements_startpoint}  ${first_measurements_endpoint}
    ...                                                     Execute L3call and Return Measurements Timestamps
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     measurement_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     cycles=${cycles}
    ...                                                     start_l3call_before_new_measurement=${start_l3call_before_new_measurement}
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     linux_congestion=${linux_congestion}
    ...                                                     prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                                     ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing commissioning with second SCF file: ${second_scf_file_path}
    Perform commissioning and achieve On Air                scf_file_path=${second_scf_file_path}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${second_measurements_startpoint}  ${second_measurements_endpoint}
    ...                                                     Execute L3call and Return Measurements Timestamps
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     measurement_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     cycles=${cycles}
    ...                                                     start_l3call_before_new_measurement=${start_l3call_before_new_measurement}
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     linux_congestion=${linux_congestion}
    ...                                                     prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                                     ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting 15 minutes for data to be available on Scout...
    Sleep                                                   15min

    Robot Log Operation                                     Triggering Scout Comparator report generation...
    ${report_id}=                                           scout_comparator.trigger_report_generation
    ...                                                     scout_tl_name=${scout_tl_name}
    ...                                                     template_id=${scout_template_id}
    ...                                                     reference_start_time=${first_measurements_startpoint}
    ...                                                     reference_end_time=${first_measurements_endpoint}
    ...                                                     first_period_description=first_run
    ...                                                     current_start_time=${second_measurements_startpoint}
    ...                                                     current_end_time=${second_measurements_endpoint}
    ...                                                     second_period_description=second_run
    ...                                                     alpha=${alpha}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for Scout Comparator calculation...
    wait until keyword succeeds                             15min
    ...                                                     5min
    ...                                                     Verify Scout Comparator Calculation
    ...                                                     report_id=${report_id}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                     Validating Scout Comparator report with ID: ${report_id}...
    scout_comparator.validate_report                        report_id=${report_id}

Execute L3call and Return Measurements Timestamps
    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${cell_type}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${measurement_interval}
    ...            ${cycles}
    ...            ${start_l3call_before_new_measurement}
    ...            ${throughputs}
    ...            ${protocol}
    ...            ${udp_buffer}
    ...            ${linux_congestion}
    ...            ${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...            ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    ${cell_dist_names}                                      admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    
    ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}                      measurements_timer.convert_time_parameter_from_minutes_format_to_int
    ...                                                     time_parameter=${measurement_interval}
    ${start_l3call_before_new_measurement_in_minutes}       measurements_timer.convert_time_parameter_from_minutes_format_to_int
    ...                                                     time_parameter=${start_l3call_before_new_measurement}
    ${measurement_interval_in_seconds}                      Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}*60
    ${measurements_time}                                    Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}*${cycles}

    ${call_duration}=                                       Evaluate  (${cycles}+1)*${measurement_interval_in_seconds}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting until ${start_l3call_before_new_measurement_in_minutes} minutes before next counter frame to start L3 Call procedure...
    measurements_timer.wait_until_moment_before_next_measurement
    ...                                                     measurement_interval=${measurement_interval_in_minutes}
    ...                                                     time_before_next_measurement=${start_l3call_before_new_measurement_in_minutes}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting L3 call with downlink and uplink transmissions...
    Alarms.Allow Alarms Before L3 Call
    Start L3 Call In Background                             called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     direction=UL_DL
    ...                                                     duration=${call_duration}s
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     linux_congestion=${linux_congestion}
    ...                                                     prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                                     ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting up to ${measurement_interval} for a new clear counters frame start...
    ${measurements_startpoint}                              Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     return_datetime_with_local_timezone=${True}
    Robot Log Result                                        New clear counters frame starts at ${measurements_startpoint}

    ${measurements_endpoint}                                measurements_timer.get_datetime_of_the_end_of_measurements
    ...                                                     measurements_start=${measurements_startpoint}
    ...                                                     measurement_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     count_of_measurement_frames=${cycles}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting ${measurements_time} minutes for end of counters measurements.
    measurements_timer.wait_for_measurement                 datetime_of_measurement=${measurements_endpoint}

    Verify Background L3 Call Results                       called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}

    [Return]    ${measurements_startpoint}  ${measurements_endpoint}

Verify Scout Comparator Calculation
    [Arguments]    ${report_id}

    ${is_calculated}                                        scout_comparator.validate_report_calculation_successful
    ...                                                     report_id=${report_id}
    Should Be True                                          ${is_calculated}
    ...                                                     msg=Scout Comparator report calculation was not successful within given time period.
